{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1175857-chronicles-of-darkness-art-resources","id":1175857,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness Art Resources","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-13T15:57:32-08:00","id":1175857,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness Art Resources","content":"Hey! I've been making some art resources for a Chronicle of Darkness game I've been running which I thought I'd share with you guys. These are free so go ahead and use them in your games.<br /> <img src=\"https://orig00.deviantart.net/2e78/f/2018/013/c/1/joe_schmoe_token_by_azzyfree_art-dbzwd2z.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <b>Joe Schmoe</b>- Resident expert in the supernatural. If only he had the wisdom to realize when he was actually up against something supernatural. He's very easy to convince into believing any sort of conspiracy theory. He's run's a ghost hunting team called the 'Ghost Stakers' which has a web series. <br /> Some trouble he has gotten into has included: Accidently forming a contract with a true fae. Seeing a werewolf transform but being convinced it was all a vr simulation, finding an angelic tool but using it as a toothpick.<br /> <br /> My group has adored this character and all the crazy shenanigans he gets into. So if you need a human who's constantly getting into trouble he's your guy.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://orig00.deviantart.net/d107/f/2018/013/e/a/mr_rook_by_azzyfree_art-dbzwd2n.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <b>Mr Rook</b>- A businessman who works at a gamedev company in london. He is a very private but well dressed person. He's a bachelor but that's not because he isn't looking for a relationship, but rather that he's hiding a dark secret. <br /> <br /> In my game he's a werewolf. But in your game he could be something else entirely. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Here is the background for the token if you want to add your own images to the token:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://orig00.deviantart.net/999c/f/2018/013/b/6/wod_frames_human_by_azzyfree_art-dbzwd40.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> If you guys have any characters/ art assets you want to share please share them here!</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13521-azairis","name":"azairis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13521_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}